#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Preprocessor: `#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`. **`$${name}`** "
"expands during assembly (global, `vars.xml`); **`${name}`** expands at "
"call time on a channel ([Chapter "
"3](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)). "
"Flattened file: `$log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (typically "
"`$prefix/log/`; comment in `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`). Do not edit it"
" while running."
msgstr ""
"预处理器：`#include` / `#set` / `X-PRE-PROCESS`。**`$${name}`** "
"在组装时展开（全局，`vars.xml`）；**`${name}`** 在呼叫时对通道展开（[第 3 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/configuration/xml)）。展平文件：`$log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（通常在"
" `$prefix/log/`；见 `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` 注释）。运行中不要编辑。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:36
#: 3b20f4e63be24f489c1394a851a613b0
msgid ""
"Modules and other autoload files are **not** opened by disk basename. "
"`switch_xml_open_cfg(\"modules.conf\", …)` locates `configuration` with "
"`name=\"modules.conf\"` inside the `configuration` section "
"(`src/switch_xml.c`). How `<load module=\"mod_sofia\"/>` becomes "
"`dlopen`: [Architecture](01-architecture.md#runtime-load-tag), "
"[Workflows](05-workflows.md#runtime-load-tag)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:38
#: a67aab197c20494fae4df5c21660a66f
msgid ""
"Directory / dialplan / SIP-profile parameter tables: [Users Manual Ch "
"6](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/user-"
"directory), [Ch "
"12](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/dialplan/xml), [Ch "
"7](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles). This page lists the **contracts as implemented in this tree**,"
" not every XML attribute."
msgstr ""
"号码簿 / 拨号计划 / SIP profile 参数表：[用户手册第 6 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/user-"
"directory)、[第 12 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/dialplan/xml)、[第 7 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles)。本页列出的是**本仓库已实现的契约**，不是每一个 XML 属性。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:40
#: 6bca36662e7140eeb96d9b68fa7dedf0
msgid "Storage and Persistence Rules"
msgstr "存储与持久化规则"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:42
#: 350b11a33e44463c83d1aa42097bcb4a
msgid ""
"**Primary storage**: SQLite core DB under the configured `db_dir` (the "
"documented `--disable-fhs` developer prefix uses `$prefix/db`; custom FHS"
" prefixes use `$prefix/var/lib/freeswitch/db`). Initialized in "
"`switch_core_init`. Optional ODBC / `mod_pgsql` / `mod_mariadb`. Disable "
"scoreboard with `freeswitch -nosql`."
msgstr ""
"**主存储**：位于已配置 `db_dir` 下的 SQLite 核心数据库（文档所述 `--disable-fhs` 开发者前缀使用 "
"`$prefix/db`；自定义 FHS 前缀使用 `$prefix/var/lib/freeswitch/db`）。在 "
"`switch_core_init` 中初始化。可选 ODBC / `mod_pgsql` / `mod_mariadb`。用 "
"`freeswitch -nosql` 禁用记分板。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:47
#: 3ab1c03420e44358a627fffe46215b96
msgid ""
"**Schema source**: SQL strings in C, not migrations. Core: "
"`src/switch_core_sqldb.c` (`create_channels_sql`, `create_calls_sql`, "
"`create_interfaces_sql`, `create_tasks_sql`, `create_nat_sql`, "
"`create_registrations_sql`, `recovery_sql`, aliases/complete). Sofia: "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_glue.c` (`sip_registrations`, "
"`sip_presence`, `sip_dialogs`, `sip_subscriptions`, `sip_authentication`,"
" shared-appearance tables)."
msgstr ""
"**模式来源**：C 中的 SQL "
"字符串，而非迁移。核心：`src/switch_core_sqldb.c`（`create_channels_sql`、`create_calls_sql`、`create_interfaces_sql`、`create_tasks_sql`、`create_nat_sql`、`create_registrations_sql`、`recovery_sql`、aliases/complete）。Sofia：`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/sofia_glue.c`（`sip_registrations`、`sip_presence`、`sip_dialogs`、`sip_subscriptions`、`sip_authentication"
"`、shared-appearance 表）。"

