" UI. It registers XML-RPC at `/RPC2`, exposes FreeSWITCH API commands "
"through `/api/`, `/webapi/`, `/txtapi/`, and `/xmlapi/`, and serves "
"static files from the core `htdocs_dir`. The module redirects `/portal` "
"to `/portal/index.html`, so a portal page can be installed at "
"`<htdocs_dir>/portal/index.html` (the bundled starter assets are under "
"`htdocs/portal/`). The htdocs directory can be overridden with the "
"process `-htdocs` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:77
#: 880a11281c4640e5932f9db9224f4c43
msgid ""
"The module is compiled when `xml_int/mod_xml_rpc` is enabled in the "
"build-time `modules.conf`; runtime loading is separate: "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/modules.conf.xml` must contain `<load "
"module=\"mod_xml_rpc\"/>`, and "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/xml_rpc.conf.xml` controls the HTTP port "
"and Basic Authentication. Supplying all three `auth-realm`, `auth-user`, "
"and `auth-pass` parameters protects non-`/pub` HTTP requests. `/pub` is "
"intended for public static content and bypasses that authentication hook."
msgstr ""

