msgstr "校验与兼容性"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:173
#: d70488e5fd5d451d99552277e5c0529c
msgid ""
"**XML**: well-formed document after preprocessor; bad root fails startup "
"(`switch_xml_open_root`). Dialplan conditions are regex on channel "
"fields/vars (`mod_dialplan_xml`)."
msgstr "**XML**：预处理器之后必须是格式良好的文档；根节点错误会导致启动失败（`switch_xml_open_root`）。拨号计划条件是对通道字段/变量的正则（`mod_dialplan_xml`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:174
#: 0e6f1d87e8c04cc4842f9640247ca442
msgid ""
"**SIP auth**: directory digest + profile `auth-calls` + ACL (`apply-"
"inbound-acl` → `domains` list in `acl.conf.xml`)."
msgstr ""
"**SIP 认证**：directory digest + 配置文件 `auth-calls` + ACL（`apply-inbound-acl`"
" → `acl.conf.xml` 中的 `domains` 列表）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:175
#: b4059137a62c4cddae2162fb56b18455
msgid ""
"**ESL**: ACL is checked **before** `auth/request`. A denied source IP "
"gets `Content-Type: text/rude-rejection` / `Access Denied, go away.` "
"(`mod_event_socket.c`). If `apply-inbound-acl` is unset, the default list"
" is `loopback.auto`. After ACL allow, the client must `auth`; wrong "
"password closes the socket (`-ERR invalid`). Remote clients: [Remote "
"Event Socket ACL](../5.operations/01-runbook.md#remote-event-socket-acl)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:176
#: fca220055f174b07a42642e46fec3808
msgid ""
"**API/apps**: stringly typed; `help` / app syntax strings are the "
"contract. Unknown API → error text, not HTTP codes."
msgstr "**API/应用**：字符串类型；`help` / 应用语法字符串即契约。未知 API 返回错误文本，而不是 HTTP 状态码。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:177
#: f2dcb0eb5fd344e683ee68285ce3a778
msgid ""
"**Backward compatibility**: event **names** and common headers are the "
"long-lived contract (1.x line). Adding headers is common; removing "
"`Event-Name` / `Unique-ID` is not. XML schema is conventional, not XSD-"
"enforced (DTD folder `dtd/` exists for some docs). Version is "
"`1.11.3-dev` in `configure.ac`."
msgstr ""
"**向后兼容**：事件**名称**与常见头是长期契约（1.x 系列）。增加头很常见；删除 `Event-Name` / `Unique-ID` "
"则不是。XML schema 是约定俗成的，并非 XSD 强制（`dtd/` 目录存在于部分文档）。版本为 `configure.ac` 中的 "
"`1.11.3-dev`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/1.architecture/04-data-and-api.md:178
#: 1e56b786eb254c34944a4be359f44b7e
msgid ""
"**Secrets in contracts**: vanilla directory passwords and ESL `ClueCon` "
"are demo values — not a stable security model."
msgstr "**契约中的密钥**：vanilla directory 密码和 ESL `ClueCon` 是演示值——不是稳定的安全模型。"

